Subject: [ODROID-U3] Linux7.3.1 identity, thermal, USB, IRQ and audio fixes

Full local patch against signed upstream Linux7.3.1.
Retains functional optional-VBUS, stream-DMA, capture-graph and HDMI fixes.
The unneeded secondary I2S parent change from intermediate revisions is absent.

